  <object class="GtkAboutDialog" id="emulator_aboutdialog">
    <property name="can_focus">False</property>
    <property name="border_width">5</property>
    <property name="resizable">False</property>
    <property name="type_hint">dialog</property>
    <property name="program_name">Sharp MZ-800 - Emulator</property>
    <property name="version">{version_is_inserted_automaticly}</property>
    <property name="copyright" translatable="yes">© 2015 - Michal Hučík - ORDOZ
2b || !2b

Special thanks to Zdeněk Ádler, Roman Dolejší,
Petr Odehnal, Martin Veverka and more  "Sharp's Men", who explored and  
documented many hidden secrets of the computer Sharp MZ-800.
</property>
    <property name="comments" translatable="yes">Come closer my friend. Sit down and listen the story from a very old days.
From time when data were real zeros and ones and computers were
 still real computers ...</property>
    <property name="website">http://ordoz.com/mz800emu</property>
    <property name="website_label" translatable="yes">www.ordoz.com/mz800emu</property>
    <property name="logo">mz800emu_logo.png</property>
    <property name="license_type">gpl-3-0</property>
    <signal name="delete-event" handler="on_emulator_aboutdialog_delete_event" swapped="no"/>
    <child internal-child="vbox">
      <object class="GtkBox" id="aboutdialog-vbox1">
        <property name="can_focus">False</property>
        <property name="spacing">2</property>
        <child internal-child="action_area">
